{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/Speed_alone_won_t_save_you_Full.png?t=1749563367\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rumbly is a fast-paced turn-based roguelike that rewards precision, rhythm, and instinct. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rhythm, reflex, and instinct are your greatest weapons. Time your attacks, master enemy patterns, and unleash the power of a true feathery fighter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/Fast-Paced__Accuracy-Driven_Combat.png?t=1749563367\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The faster and more precisely you act, the more <strong>devastating your combos</strong> become. Every turn is a chance to prove your reflexes \u2014 or fall flat.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press the right buttons to attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time your attacks for <strong>extra damage and fever bonus</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fever Mode</strong> boosts your damage and pauses the countdown timer!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/fever.gif?t=1749563367\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/Dodge__Adapt__Survive.png?t=1749563367\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read enemy patterns, dodge in rhythm, and adapt your tactics. From swarms of bats to sentinels, each enemy attacks differently \u2014 and expects you to keep up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your skills to dodge the attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Varied attack patterns keep battles exciting!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/batAttack.gif?t=1749563367\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/snailAttack.gif?t=1749563367\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/Skill___Blessings.png?t=1749563367\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock flashy, high-impact skills and combine them with <strong>Blessings</strong> that change the rules of battle each run. Build powerful synergies or gamble on chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every 3 floors, you'll receive a <strong>Blessing Buff</strong> that makes you stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every Blessing buff comes with its own set condition bonus, allowing you to customize your build freely.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roguelike progression ensures a dynamic and  replay experience!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/blessing2.gif?t=1749563367\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/Shops.png?t=1749563367\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use earned currency to unlock permanent upgrades, new characters, or skills. Your climb gets better every time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Purchase new characters and skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some items are unlocked\u00a0by meeting special conditions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/shop.gif?t=1749563367\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/Just_One_More_Run.png?t=1749563367\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With tight battles, satisfying progression, and cute-but-deadly bird warriors \u2014 <i>Rumbly</i> will keep you flapping \u2018til sunrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist now and join the fight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/WislistFull.png?t=1749563367\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612210?t=1749563367","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/9c4cc1ac931d4222c02173db6c049605d0814eeb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749563367","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/3f83be836b87292e29c4b17788984d13d84e7ed2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749563367","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/3f83be836b87292e29c4b17788984d13d84e7ed2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749563367","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3754690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/Speed_alone_won_t_save_you_Full.png?t=1749563367\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rumbly is a fast-paced turn-based roguelike that rewards precision, rhythm, and instinct. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rhythm, reflex, and instinct are your greatest weapons. Time your attacks, master enemy patterns, and unleash the power of a true feathery fighter.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/Fast-Paced__Accuracy-Driven_Combat.png?t=1749563367\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The faster and more precisely you act, the more <strong>devastating your combos</strong> become. Every turn is a chance to prove your reflexes \u2014 or fall flat.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press the right buttons to attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time your attacks for <strong>extra damage and fever bonus</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fever Mode</strong> boosts your damage and pauses the countdown timer!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/fever.gif?t=1749563367\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/Dodge__Adapt__Survive.png?t=1749563367\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read enemy patterns, dodge in rhythm, and adapt your tactics. From swarms of bats to sentinels, each enemy attacks differently \u2014 and expects you to keep up.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your skills to dodge the attack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Varied attack patterns keep battles exciting!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/batAttack.gif?t=1749563367\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612210/extras/snailAttack.gif?t=1749563367\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a